@startuml
skinparam monochrome true
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam dpi 120
hide empty members
top to bottom direction
title SkyCrop - Subscriptions and Payment Management - Diseño por capas
package "Interfaces / Presentation" {
class SubscriptionController <<controller>> {
-service: ISubscriptionApplicationService
+acquire(request: AcquireSubscriptionRequest): SubscriptionResource
+getById(id: Long): SubscriptionResource
}
class AcquireSubscriptionRequest <<request>> {
-userId: Long
-type: SubscriptionType
}
class SubscriptionResource <<resource>> {
-id: Long
}
class SubscriptionResourceAssembler <<assembler>> {
+toResource(entity: Subscription): SubscriptionResource
}
}
package "Application" {
class AcquireSubscriptionCommand <<command>> {
-userId: Long
-type: SubscriptionType
}
interface ISubscriptionApplicationService {
+acquire(command: AcquireSubscriptionCommand): SubscriptionResource
+getById(id: Long): SubscriptionResource
}
class SubscriptionApplicationService <<application service>> {
-repository: ISubscriptionRepository
+acquire(command: AcquireSubscriptionCommand): SubscriptionResource
+getById(id: Long): SubscriptionResource
}
}
package "Domain" {
class Subscription <<aggregate root>> {
-id: Long
-period: SubscriptionPeriod
-status: SubscriptionStatus
+activate(): void
}
interface ISubscriptionRepository <<repository contract>> {
+findById(id: Long): Subscription [0..1]
+save(entity: Subscription): void
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class SubscriptionRepository <<repository>> {
-dbContext: SkyCropDbContext
+findById(id: Long): Subscription [0..1]
+save(entity: Subscription): void
}
class SkyCropDbContext <<EF Core>> {
+saveChanges(): int
}
}
SubscriptionController --> ISubscriptionApplicationService : delega
SubscriptionController ..> AcquireSubscriptionRequest : recibe
SubscriptionController ..> AcquireSubscriptionCommand : construye
SubscriptionController ..> SubscriptionResource : responde
SubscriptionApplicationService ..|> ISubscriptionApplicationService
ISubscriptionApplicationService ..> AcquireSubscriptionCommand : recibe
SubscriptionApplicationService --> ISubscriptionRepository : consulta y persiste
SubscriptionApplicationService ..> Subscription : ejecuta operaciones
SubscriptionApplicationService ..> SubscriptionResourceAssembler : transforma
SubscriptionResourceAssembler ..> Subscription : lee
SubscriptionResourceAssembler ..> SubscriptionResource : produce
SubscriptionRepository ..|> ISubscriptionRepository
ISubscriptionRepository ..> Subscription : contrato de persistencia
SubscriptionRepository --> SkyCropDbContext : acceso a datos
package "Application" {
interface IPaymentGateway <<integration contract>> {
+authorize(subscriptionId: Long, amount: Money): boolean
}
}
package "Infrastructure" {
class PaymentGatewayAdapter <<adapter>> {
+authorize(subscriptionId: Long, amount: Money): boolean
}
}
SubscriptionApplicationService --> IPaymentGateway : solicita operación
PaymentGatewayAdapter ..|> IPaymentGateway
note bottom of PaymentGatewayAdapter
Solicita autorización de una transacción a la pasarela.
end note
SubscriptionController -[hidden]down-> SubscriptionApplicationService
SubscriptionApplicationService -[hidden]down-> Subscription
Subscription -[hidden]down-> SubscriptionRepository
legend bottom
Arquitectura de clases propuesta para el backend RESTful API.
La vista muestra un caso de uso del contexto y su consulta por identidad.
Los atributos del agregado se detallan en las vistas del dominio.
Las dependencias de infraestructura implementan contratos internos.
endlegend
@enduml
